#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:2
msgid "MySQL Too many connections error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:4
msgid "If you see the following error in the |morpheus| UI logs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:6
msgid ""
"SqlExceptionHelper - Data source rejected establishment of connection,  "
"message from server: \"Too many connections\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:10
msgid ""
"it means the number connections between |morpheus| application and mysql "
"have reached the `max_connections` limit set in mysql (default is 151), "
"or the `max_active` setting, which limits the number of connections on "
"the |morpheus| end (default is 150), and the limit needs to be raised, "
"either in |morpheus| or mysql, or both depending on the number of "
"connections and configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:12
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:12
msgid ""
"The `max_connections` setting in mysql and the maximum used connections "
"between an app node and mysql can be viewed in the |morpheus| ui in the "
"`Administration - Health` section under Database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:14
#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:16
#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:34
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:14
msgid ""
"In Single |morpheus| app node configurations, the ``max_active`` setting "
"on the app node must be less than the ``max_connections`` setting in "
"mysql."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:16
msgid ""
"In HA configurations, the ``max_active`` setting is per app node, and the"
" ``max_connections`` setting in mysql must be greater than all app nodes "
"``max_active`` values combined, ie ``(max_active`` * "
"$number_of_app_nodes) <= max_connections``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:19
msgid "|morpheus| ``max_active`` setting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:21
msgid ""
"Edit ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` and add ``mysql[‘max_active’] = "
"$value`` replacing ``$value`` with desired desired number of maximum "
"connections allowed by |morpheus| to mysql. For example, to set "
"max_active at 150:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:23
msgid "mysql[‘max_active’] = 150"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:27
msgid ""
"Replacing 100 with the desired number of maximum connections allowed by "
"|morpheus| to mysql."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:29
msgid ""
"Run ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure`` for the setting to be applied. "
"Reconfigure will not restart the ui unless additional ram has been added "
"to the appliance host since the previous reconfigure. To edit the "
"max_active without a reconfigure, update the ``max_active`` setting in "
"``/opt/morpheus/conf/application.yml``. Please note the default setting "
"of 150 will be applied upon the next reconfigure unless ``max_active`` is"
" defined as instructed above in the ``morpheus.rb`` file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:32
msgid "mysql ``max_connections`` setting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:34
msgid ""
"Customers are responsible for configuring and maintaining external "
"databases used by |morpheus|. This explains how to set the "
"``max_connections`` setting, but the value for the setting needs to be "
"established by a customers qualified db admin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:36
msgid "In mysql prompt,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:38
msgid "run ``mysql> SET GLOBAL max_connections = $value;``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:40
msgid ""
"This will immediately write the variable, however it is only a temporary "
"setting that will be overwritten upon restart of the mysql service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:42
msgid ""
"To persist the ``max_connections`` setting, edit my.cnf, and add "
"``max_connections = $value`` replacing ``$value`` with desired value, ie "
"to set max_connections at 300 in in my.cnf, add:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../troubleshooting/MYSQL_toomanyconnections.rst:44
msgid "max_connections = 300"
msgstr ""

